# armour/man/mail_stride: the hauberk's two skirt rows in the side walk's REACH frames, keyed by the legs (MAN-WEAR, P2B
# rollout, 2026-10-22): the reach keys (walkB2, walkD2) draw the hang's frozen rest view, so mail_hang cannot carry the skirt
# there; these views do, pixel for pixel the rows mail.pxm's run view drew before. Every other key draws nothing.
# Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
# (LADDER-ARMOUR i3) the 1px checker re-laid as STYLE_P2 25.2's brick: lit side courses yyx / xyy (steps 3/2), shadow side xww / wwx
# (steps 2/1), alternate rows offset, so mail reads as rings and a fine grey fabric, never a chessboard (the blind panel).
# (LADDER-ARMOUR polish i2) mail as lit planes with a sparse ring dot (mailfix.py), as the hauberk
use person
body man
role armour mail
layer hangFront
anchor hip
keys legs
z 10

view D key walkB2 origin 0 0
|.

view U key walkB2 origin 0 0
|.

view D key walkD2 origin 0 0
|.

view U key walkD2 origin 0 0
|.

view R key walkB2 origin 6 -1
|vyxyyxxwwxwv.
|vyyyxyxxwwwwv
regions
|.............
|.RRRRR.......
build
|...+.........

view R key walkD2 origin 6 -1
|vyxyyxxwwxwv.
|vyyyxyxxwwwwv
regions
|.............
|.RRRRR.......
build
|...+.........

view L key walkB2 origin 8 -1
|.vyyxywwxwwxwv
|vyyyxyxxwxwwwv
regions
|..............
|.RRRRRR.......
build
|..........+...

view L key walkD2 origin 8 -1
|.vyyxywwxwwxwv
|vyyyxyxxwxwwwv
regions
|..............
|.RRRRRR.......
build
|..........+...

# ---- (P2c SLICE-ARMOUR, ADD) every other legs key the loco, run, drawn and death clips take: empty (the panel is the walk's)
